title: "S-IMPL-08 — Realisasi Booking (BookingAdminController::realisasikan, LayananBooking::realisasikan)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant V as Vue 3 + Inertia<br/>Admin/Booking/Realisasi.vue
    participant R as RealisasiBookingRequest<br/>(Gate kelola-transaksi)
    participant C as BookingAdminController
    participant S as LayananBooking
    participant K as LayananKedaluwarsaBooking
    participant DB as MySQL 8.4
    A->>V: Pilih booking Disetujui, isi Tanggal Jatuh Tempo → konfirmasi
    V->>C: POST /admin/booking/{kode}/realisasi
    C->>R: authorize() + rules()
    C->>S: realisasikan(kode, jatuhTempo, admin)
    rect rgb(235, 242, 255)
        Note over S,DB: DB::transaction — kunci members → bookings
        S->>DB: SELECT … FOR UPDATE (members, bookings)
        alt expires_at ≤ sekarang (penjadwal belum berjalan)
            S->>K: terapkanTerkunci() → Kedaluwarsa, lepas eksemplar, audit
            K->>DB: UPDATE bookings, book_copies, INSERT audit_logs
            S->>DB: COMMIT
            S-->>V: galat validasi — "Booking sudah kedaluwarsa…"
        else Belum lewat batas
            S->>DB: SELECT … FOR UPDATE (book_copies) — harus Dipesan untuk booking ini
            S->>DB: INSERT loans (Aktif, booking_id, staff_id, due_date)
            S->>DB: UPDATE bookings → Direalisasikan
            S->>DB: UPDATE book_copies → Dipinjam
            S->>DB: INSERT audit_logs peminjaman.dibuat + booking.direalisasikan
            S->>DB: COMMIT
            C-->>V: 302 + bukti "BP-… direalisasikan menjadi PJ-…"
        end
    end
